	<package>
		<name>MacOS Microsoft Windows App</name>
		<application_name>Windows App</application_name>
		<bundleId>com.microsoft.rdc.macos</bundleId>
		<currentVersionReleaseDate>September 29, 2026</currentVersionReleaseDate>
		<icon_image>https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/96/9f/4a/969f4a04-6289-d352-93f7-3f69f70f995f/AppIcon-0-0-85-220-0-0-6-0-2x.png/512x512bb.png</icon_image>
		<minimumOsVersion>14.0</minimumOsVersion>
		<releaseNotes>In this release we made the following updates to address issues with RemoteApp connections:

• Resolved an issue where the secure desktop window would appear empty while connecting to a remote app when using multiple monitors.
• Fixed mispaints that occurred if advanced RemoteFX graphics were not being used to render remote apps.

We also fixed some other bugs:

• Fixed issues with ALT-based shortcuts (such as ALT+ENTER and ALT+UP ARROW) in Unicode keyboard mode.
• Resolved modifier-key state that could interfere with subsequent SHIFT-based mouse click selections and keyboard shortcuts.
• Fixed a startup hang that prevented command-line operations from completing.
• Handled connection failures caused by saved credentials containing a domain but no username (users will be prompted to correct invalid credentials).

In addition, we made improvements to enhance diagnostics insights:

• Improved classification of sign-in errors to better distinguish access restrictions from internal authentication failures.
• Improved connection and workspace diagnostics by identifying whether a signed-in Entra account is a home or guest account.
• Fixed an issue where UDP connection drops caused by network instability were incorrectly classified.

We have also added a toggle to enable WebAuthn redirection for AVD and Windows 365-based connections (Settings &gt; General &gt; Use WebAuthn redirection). Individual PC connections can be opted out of WebAuthn redirection by configuring published PC custom settings (under the Devices &amp; Audio tab).

If you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Help &gt; Submit Feedback.</releaseNotes>
		<version>11.4.3</version>
		<app_store_url>https://apps.apple.com/us/app/windows-app/id1295203466?mt=12&amp;uo=4</app_store_url>
	</package>
